  "html": "<h2>What each scm: relation did, on GitHub’s own page</h2>\n<div class=\"split\" style=\"grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 7fr) minmax(0, 5fr)\">\n  <figure><img src=\"media/gh504.png\" alt=\"GitHub's page for pull request #2337, with five numbered boxes: the title, the merged state, the head sha, the squash merge and the comment\"></figure>\n  <div class=\"rows\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">1</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:pulls-get</b></code><br>Read pull request 2337, kept as pr.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">2</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>state, merged</b></code><br>state: closed, merged: true, read after the act.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">3</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>head.sha</b></code><br>The head the view had: GitHub merges only if it’s still there.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">4</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:merge {method: squash}</b></code><br>Squashed into library/main as 1361304.</div></div>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.9rem;align-items:flex-start\"><span style=\"flex:none;display:grid;place-items:center;width:2.2rem;height:2.2rem;border-radius:50%;background:#e3b341;color:#17201b;font-weight:700\">5</span><div><code style=\"background:none;padding:0;font-size:1.15rem;color:var(--leaf)\"><b>scm:comment {body}</b></code><br>“Not promoted to Dev: smoke scenarios S3 failed.”</div></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n",
  "say": "Pull request #2337 on real GitHub, variant 504: merged, then the smoke test failed scenario S3, so it wasn't promoted and the script commented. Each box is something one scm: relation read or did. The page is GitHub's; ARTIE never saw it, only the gateway's HAL Schema Forms.",
